to: sauce-chef
topic: opening-menu-sauces

Use shared/menu-direction.md and shared/menu-draft.md as binding.

Develop the sauces, broths, condiments, and acidic finishes for tasting courses
1 through 6 and a la carte dishes 1 through 12. Cross-utilize components where
it improves prep efficiency, but identify how seasoning or finishing keeps each
dish distinct.

For every component, provide a concise formula or ratio, technique, holding
limit, service temperature, allergens, and dairy-free adaptation where relevant.
Flag any pairing that is too smoky, too citrus-heavy, or operationally fragile.

Write the full deliverable to shared/sauce-development.md and return it in the
handoff message to head-chef with topic opening-menu-sauces.
